{"id":45604,"date":"2025-10-06T07:39:50","date_gmt":"2025-10-06T06:39:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=45604"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:54:39","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:54:39","slug":"terrugem-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/terrugem-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Terrugem Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A prova<strong>&nbsp;9\u00ba Terrugem Trail<\/strong>&nbsp;tem como objetivo proporcionar aos atletas novas experi\u00eancias e sensa\u00e7\u00f5es em trilhos distintos, valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o do territ\u00f3rio e promo\u00e7\u00e3o da nossa regi\u00e3o.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Este evento ir\u00e1 decorrer no dia&nbsp;<strong>01 mar\u00e7o de 2026<\/strong>, organizado pela<strong>&nbsp;ABIT &#8211; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de Bicicletas de Terrugem.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O&nbsp;<strong>Trail Longo e Trail Curto<\/strong>&nbsp;s\u00e3o ainda provas que integram e pontuam para o&nbsp;<strong>Circuito Trail da Freguesia<\/strong>. O Trail Curto e Mini Trail s\u00e3o provas integrantes do&nbsp;<strong>Circuito de Trail Regional de Lisboa &#8211; AAL.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46314,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-45604","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-terrugem-sintra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/up